.TH rayscan-scripts-install 1  "install " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-scripts\-install \- Install a pack directory into the local script library
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBinstall\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIR\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install a pack directory into the local script library
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing installed pack of the same name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>
Pack directory to validate and copy into the library
